OL,3,ACanada is a 'safe harbour' for global
OL,4,Afinance, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney is pitching
OL,7,FCanada as a "safe harbour" for some of
OL,8,Fthe world's largest investors in an era
OL,9,Fof geopolitical and economic
OL,10,Funcertainty.
OL,12,FCanada is "perfectly situated to build
OL,13,Fin the new global economic order", he
OL,14,Ftold more than 100 major investors
OL,15,Fbeing courted by Ottawa on Tuesday.
