OL,3,ACanada is a 'safe harbour' for global
OL,4,Afinance, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarney has pledged to bring in C$1tn in
OL,7,Finvestments in the b@Lnext bA five
OL,8,Fyears as he seeks to reduce Canada's
OL,9,Freliance on the US, and the summit this
OL,10,Fweek is a test of whether he can
OL,11,Fdeliver on promises to strengthen
OL,12,Feconomic resilience.
OL,14,FHis aim is to have the group,
OL,15,Frepresenting more than C$120tn ($86tn;
OL,16,F#64tn) of assets, invest in sectors
OL,17,Flike defence, energy, mining, AI and
OL,18,Finfrastructure.
